    },
    {
      "text": "At the entrance, eighteen foreign girls stand in two rows.",
      "chapters": [
        296
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan tells Bai Feng he is starving and asks to be treated at the third inner city’s most famous Shi Zi restaurant. Bai Feng agrees because the whereabouts of Bai clan’s two young clan leaders matter to the clan’s future.",
      "chapters": [
        294
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "private-room-after-bai-clan-arrives",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_feng",
        "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The place is not only a restaurant; it is a luxurious brothel. It brings in women from foreign lands such as Northern Plains, Eastern Seas, and Western Desert, and its speciality is lion meatball served on a human, with the name holding the meaning of eating food and also ‘eating human’. Fang Yuan chooses it for its strong background and many secret private rooms where Shang clansmen conceal their names for private affairs. He sits with the Bai group in a secret room; they do not order lion meatball. He makes Tie Dao Ku wait outside, then tells Bai clan the two young clan leaders are dead.",
      "chapters": [
        294
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "private-room-after-bai-clan-arrives",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "char_tie_dao_ku"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the entrance, eighteen foreign girls stand in two rows as living advertisement while Tie Dao Ku and other Gu Masters guard the door. The banquet was so expensive that, without money to pay, Tie Dao Ku can only work to write off his debt, and the restaurant’s background means it does not care that he is a Tie clansman. Fang Yuan spots him there.",
      "chapters": [
        296
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tie-dao-kus-debt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Dao Ku recalls that Fang Yuan lured them to Shi Zi restaurant, Bai clan paid five hundred thousand and fled, and the restaurant arrested him and forced him to guard outside the door.",
      "chapters": [
        298
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
